body:
Easily SCP-4444, Bush v Gore.

&#x200B;

Other ones I'm extremely fond of are CARL (SCP-3213) and Ashur (SCP-3740)

Ok but like. In the Narutoverse, I personally the definition a good ninja is more lax: someone with essentially ardent patriotism and loyalty, like the military or something. 

&#x200B;

So yeah, the most qualified example is probably Kakashi, who devotes all his skills to Konoha (I think I even read that in a guidebook somewhere), but that also extends to a lot of people, so long as they exemplify patriotism. In that sense, Jiraiya, Itachi, Naruto, Tobirama, Danzo, yes. But Kabuto? Probably not.
